   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Denmark acitivites in Syria and the region, 2020 - 2021 Health Programme for Syrian Refugees and vulnerable Jordanians in Jordan</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The grant is awarded to the Caritas Denmark project: 2021 Health Programme for Syrian Refugees and Vulnerable Jordanians in Jordan.

The stated overall objective of the project is: In line with the Health Sector Overall Objective of the Jordan Response Plan 2020-2022 the project will contribute to improving the health status of Jordanian host communities and Syrian refugees by meeting humanitarian health needs, promoting resilience and strengthening the national health system and services</narrative>
  </description>
